OL,3,APaul McCartney's key sells for double
OL,4,Athe estimate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key to Sir Paul McCartney's childhood
OL,7,Fhome has sold for thousands of pounds
OL,8,Fat auction.
OL,10,FDuring the 1950s and 60s, Sir Paul
OL,11,Flived with his family at 20 Forthlin
OL,12,FRoad in Allerton, Liverpool, and
OL,13,Fcomposed some of the earliest Beatles'
OL,14,Ftracks with John Lennon there.
OL,16,FSir Paul moved out in 1963, and his
OL,17,Ffather and brother in the following
OL,18,Fyear. In 1965, American superfan Kathy
OL,19,FSalt wrote to then-occupant Ashley
OL,20,FJones, who enclosed a photograph of the
OL,21,Fhouse and a key, with a tag attached,
OL,22,Fin his letter back.
