OL,3,APaul McCartney's key sells for double
OL,4,Athe estimate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three items were sold to a British
OL,7,Fprivate collector at Dominic Winter
OL,8,FAuctioneers in the Cotswolds on
OL,9,FWednesday, fetching a hammer price of
OL,10,F#5,000 - double the estimate.
